flowchart TD
    PMRequirement(讀取PM提出需求)
    HaveIssue{是否有 Implementation Issue?}
    ReadImplementationIssue(讀取 Implementation Issue)
    RequirementAnalysis(需求分析)
    HaveRequirementProblem{PM提出的需求是否不明確}
    RequirementTypeDetection(需求類型判斷)
    ExistingSystemAnalysis(現有系統分析)
    CompareWithOriginalRequirement(與原需求比較)
    CompareWithOriginalBehavior(與原行為比較)
    CheckSystemImplementationCode(檢查系統已實現代碼)
    AnalyzeSystemImplementation(分析系統已實現代碼)
    AnalyzeSystemImpact(分析系統實現影響)
    DesignSystemImplementationPlan(設計系統實現方案)
    DoubleCheckImplementationPlan(重新確認實現方案)
    IsAutomaticAgent(是否自動化代理)
    ReviewByPM(由PM審查)
    HandoffProgrammerAgentImplementation(交接給程式設計代理人實作)

    PMRequirement --> HaveIssue
    HaveIssue -->|是| ReadImplementationIssue
    HaveIssue -->|否| RequirementAnalysis
    ReadImplementationIssue --> RequirementAnalysis
    RequirementAnalysis --> HaveRequirementProblem
    HaveRequirementProblem -->|是| ReviewByPM
    HaveRequirementProblem -->|否| RequirementTypeDetection
    RequirementTypeDetection --> |New Requirement| ExistingSystemAnalysis
    RequirementTypeDetection --> |Requirement Change| CompareWithOriginalRequirement
    RequirementTypeDetection --> |Bug / Behavior Correction|CompareWithOriginalBehavior
    ExistingSystemAnalysis --> CheckSystemImplementationCode
    CompareWithOriginalRequirement --> CheckSystemImplementationCode
    CompareWithOriginalBehavior --> CheckSystemImplementationCode
    CheckSystemImplementationCode --> AnalyzeSystemImplementation
    AnalyzeSystemImplementation --> AnalyzeSystemImpact
    AnalyzeSystemImpact --> DesignSystemImplementationPlan
    DesignSystemImplementationPlan --> DoubleCheckImplementationPlan
    DoubleCheckImplementationPlan --> IsAutomaticAgent
    IsAutomaticAgent -->|是| HandoffProgrammerAgentImplementation
    IsAutomaticAgent -->|否| ReviewByPM


